  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidation of Outbound Ticketing and 
Immigration Support Services of Follow-to-Join Asylee (FTJ-A) beneficiaries 
at CARE Doha</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will arrange for the pre-embarkation medical checks, movement, and transit assistance of USG-approved Follow to join Asylum Seekers from CARE Doha to final destinations in the United States or to other SCA/CARE-designated destinations. Comprehensive support will also include provision of operational and medical escorts, Pre-Departure Medical Procedures (PDMP), vaccination, ground movement and exit permit processing, contingency Panel Medical Exams, and interpreter services for USCIS interviews where necessary.</narrative>
  </description>
